## Step 3 — `series_config.py`

```python
from __future__ import annotations
from dataclasses import dataclass

@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)
class SeriesConfig:
    series_slug: str          # e.g. "the_office"
    series_title: str         # e.g. "The Office"
    wiki_origin: str          # e.g. "https://theoffice.fandom.com"
    season_page_template: str # e.g. "Season_{n}" — used to build season page titles

THE_OFFICE = SeriesConfig(
    series_slug="the_office",
    series_title="The Office",
    wiki_origin="https://theoffice.fandom.com",
    season_page_template="Season_{n}",
)
```

No other series yet. THE_OFFICE is the only constant needed for the MVP.

